@Portfolio.AI.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5176

### Analyze a ticket (full request)
POST {{Portfolio.AI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/TicketTriage/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketText": "The application crashes on startup and nobody on the team can sign in.",
  "context": "Production, premium customer",
  "requestedPriority": "High"
}

### Quick triage (ticket text only)
POST {{Portfolio.AI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/TicketTriage/quick
Content-Type: application/json

"Forgot my password and the reset email never arrives."
